  "identity": "Independent slag forge captain, athletic but squat armored knight. Jagged blackened steel helmet with one bent copper crest, narrow bright amber eye slit, battered rust-red half-cape, chunky bronze shoulder armor. Broad chipped iron cutlass with a glowing orange seam held low, round slag shield strapped to other arm. Short solid boots, enormous gauntlets and swaggering comic posture.",
